I built the red-brick factory as one ghost, `ab/factory_os/main`, at (200, 120, 0). It has a long main hall with a dark slate gable roof and a smaller east annex with a hipped roof. A 30-block clock tower rises from the north side, with clock faces on three sides and a lightning-rod tip. Two round brick smokestacks stand along the south side, with stone-brick buttresses between them and the hall. It sits on a rust-industrial platform.

